# LinkedIn Optimizer

## Headline formula
`Role | Key stack | Differentiator | Location`

Example: `Software Engineer | React, Node.js, PostgreSQL | SCADA & Energy | Italy`

## About section
- First 3 lines visible before "see more" — hook with role + location + stack
- 1 paragraph enterprise experience (SEIDOR)
- 1 paragraph differentiator (SCADA/energy) — brief
- CTA: open to opportunities in Italy/Europe
- Max 2600 chars

## SEO keywords (natural placement)
Software Engineer, Full Stack, React, Node.js, PostgreSQL, Docker, REST API, SCADA, Italy, Remote

## Experience bullets
Mirror CV but add metrics. End each role with tech stack line.

## Engagement
- Open to Work (recruiters-only if preferred)
- Featured: portfolio, Presuflow, CV
- Request recommendations from Lucas Delmonte, Federico Bustamante
- 1 technical post/month increases inbound visibility

## Sync rule
Any LinkedIn change must match `knowledge/profile-summary.md`. Update both files.
